### ==========================================
### RuoYi 字典管理接口探索
### ==========================================

@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 登录拿 token
# @name login
POST {{base_url}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}


### ==========================================
### 字典类型相关
### ==========================================

### 2. 字典类型列表
GET {{base_url}}/system/dict/type/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. 字典类型详情（dictId=1）
GET {{base_url}}/system/dict/type/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. 按字典类型 type 字段获取数据（前端下拉框场景）
GET {{base_url}}/system/dict/data/type/sys_user_sex
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. 字典数据列表（按 dictType 筛选）
GET {{base_url}}/system/dict/data/list?dictType=sys_user_sex
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. 新增字典类型
POST {{base_url}}/system/dict/type
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dictName": "测试字典类型",
  "dictType": "test_dict_auto",
  "status": "0",
  "remark": "自动化创建"
}


### 7. 查刚建的字典类型
# @name findAutoDict
GET {{base_url}}/system/dict/type/list?dictType=test_dict_auto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@auto_dict_id = {{findAutoDict.response.body.rows[0].dictId}}


### 8. 删除字典类型
DELETE {{base_url}}/system/dict/type/{{auto_dict_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### 字典数据相关（属于某个 dictType）
### ==========================================

### 9. 新增字典数据
POST {{base_url}}/system/dict/data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dictType": "sys_user_sex",
  "dictLabel": "测试选项",
  "dictValue": "99",
  "dictSort": 99,
  "status": "0"
}


### 10. 缓存刷新
DELETE {{base_url}}/system/dict/type/refreshCache
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}